    category: "Linux",
    title: "Steam 平台九月調查報告：Linux 市場佔有率降至 3.05%，Windows 仍佔絕對主導",
    summary: "根據 Steam 平台發布的九月調查報告，Linux 在 Steam 遊戲用戶群中的市場佔有率出現顯著下降，從前一個月的水平回落至 3.05%。相較之下，Microsoft Windows 仍維持極高的市場佔有率，佔比高達 95%。報告指出，Linux 用戶的下降趨勢，以及中文使用量的劇烈增長（增加了 7.42%，總佔比達 31.39%），可能與報告的採樣或統計問題有關。\n在 Linux 內部數據觀察，CachyOS 的使用比例增長了 2.65%，達到 18.12%，甚至超過了 SteamOS Holo 的 17.37%。此外，在 Linux 遊戲玩家群體中，AMD CPU 仍佔據高達 60% 的市場份額，這得益於 Steam Deck 和 Steam Machine 等設備對 AMD APU 的支援，以及開源/Linux 支援在愛好者中的普及。\n此報告提供了 Steam 平台生態系統的最新用戶行為趨勢，關注開發者和玩家群體對不同作業系統和硬體平台的偏好。",
    tags: ["Steam", "Linux", "SteamOS", "CachyOS", "AMD CPU", "市場佔有率"],
    title_en: "Steam Platform September Survey Report: Linux Market Share Drops to 3.05%, Windows Maintains Absolute Dominance",
    summary_en: "According to the Steam platform's September survey report, Linux's market share among Steam game users showed a noticeable decline, falling back to 3.05% from the previous month. In comparison, Microsoft Windows maintained an extremely high market share of 95%. The report suggests that the decline in Linux users, along with the dramatic increase in Chinese usage (up 7.42%, reaching a total share of 31.39%), may be related to sampling or statistical issues within the report.\n\nObserving internal Linux data, CachyOS's usage proportion increased by 2.65%, reaching 18.12%, surpassing SteamOS Holo's 17.37%. Furthermore, within the Linux gaming player base, AMD CPUs still account for a high market share of 60%. This is attributed to the support for AMD APUs in devices like the Steam Deck and Steam Machine, and the widespread adoption of open-source/Linux support among enthusiasts.\n\nThis report provides the latest user behavior trends within the Steam platform ecosystem, focusing on the preferences of developers and players for different operating systems and hardware platforms.",
    tags_en: ["Steam", "Linux", "SteamOS", "CachyOS", "AMD CPU", "Market Share"],
