    trackers: ["eu_cra"],
    category: "產業動態",
    title: "Moxa與여의시스템推出MGate G2系列，強化工控網路的通訊連線與安全性",
    summary: "本次介紹的MGate G2系列是Moxa的下一代協定閘道器（Protocol Gateway）OT網路解決方案，旨在提升工業現場的通訊連線能力、安全性、故障診斷及管理便利性。MGate閘道器能連接不同工業應用程式協定，實現設備與系統間的數據流動。MGate G2系列具備協定轉換功能，並提供WebGUI和協定診斷工具，協助用戶即時檢查通訊狀態和找出問題根源。具體而言，MB3170-G2、MB3270-G2、MB3470-G2等型號透過Agent模式高效處理Modbus數據，提升與SCADA系統的通訊效能。此外，該系列支援IEC 61850、CAN、Modbus、PROFINET、EtherNet/IP等多種工業協定，並整合HTTPS/SSH加密、Secure Boot、ACL等安全功能，確保工業網路的穩定運行。產品亦符合ATEX·CID2·IECEx、DNV、NEMA TS2等國際工業認證標準，並透過自研ASIC降低供應鏈風險。여의시스템作為Moxa的官方總代理，提供從產品選型、技術諮詢到現場組裝的專業服務，並提供MXCA/MXCP等官方認證培訓。",
    tags: ["Moxa", "여의시스템", "MGate G2", "OT網路", "協定閘道器", "工業通訊"],
    title_en: "Moxa and Yeouisystem Launch MGate G2 Series to Enhance Industrial Control Network Connectivity and Security",
    summary_en: "The MGate G2 series introduced here is Moxa's next-generation Protocol Gateway OT network solution, designed to improve communication connectivity, security, fault diagnosis, and management convenience in industrial settings. The MGate gateway connects different industrial application protocols, enabling data flow between devices and systems. The MGate G2 series features protocol conversion functionality and provides a WebGUI and protocol diagnostic tools, helping users check communication status and pinpoint the root cause of issues in real-time. Specifically, models such as MB3170-G2, MB3270-G2, and MB3470-G2 efficiently process Modbus data using Agent mode, enhancing communication performance with SCADA systems. Furthermore, the series supports multiple industrial protocols including IEC 61850, CAN, Modbus, PROFINET, and EtherNet/IP, and integrates security features such as HTTPS/SSH encryption, Secure Boot, and ACL to ensure stable industrial network operation. The product also complies with international industrial certification standards such as ATEX·CID2·IECEx, DNV, and NEMA TS2, and reduces supply chain risk through self-developed ASIC. Yeouisystem, as Moxa's official general agent, provides professional services ranging from product selection and technical consultation to on-site assembly, and offers official certifications such as MXCA/MXCP.",
