    category: "產業動態",
    title: "SK쉴더스取得AWS TDR能力認證，強化雲端威脅偵測與應對服務",
    summary: "SK쉴더斯成功取得Amazon Web Services (AWS) 的「威脅偵測與應對」（TDR）安全能力認證。AWS安全能力是評估提供AWS解決方案和服務的合作夥伴的專業性與客戶案例的評定機制。TDR能力涵蓋安全監控中心（SOC）營運、安全資訊與事件管理（SIEM）、安全協調、自動化與應對（SOAR）、擴展偵測與應對（XDR）、端點偵測與應對（EDR）以及網路偵測與應對（NDR）等威脅偵測與應對領域。取得此認證後，SK쉴더斯能為在AWS雲端環境運行服務或規劃雲端轉型的企業提供高效能的資安環境。目前，其服務結合了AWS原生安全服務與AI基礎的資安監控平台「Secudium」，提供優化的雲端安全監控服務。SK쉴더斯未來計劃利用累積的雲端資安專業知識，將服務範圍擴展至更多產業，協助客戶應對日益複雜的網路威脅。",
    tags: ["SK쉴더스", "AWS", "TDR", "SOC", "SIEM", "SOAR", "XDR", "雲端資安"],
    title_en: "SK Shieldus Achieves AWS TDR Capability Certification, Strengthening Cloud Threat Detection and Response Services",
    summary_en: "SK Shieldus has successfully obtained Amazon Web Services (AWS) 'Threat Detection and Response' (TDR) security capability certification. AWS security capabilities are an assessment mechanism that evaluates the professionalism of partners providing AWS solutions and services, along with client case studies. The TDR capability covers various threat detection and response domains, including Security Operations Center (SOC) operations, Security Information and Event Management (SIEM), security coordination, Security Orchestration, Automation, and Response (SOAR), Extended Detection and Response (XDR), Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR), and Network Detection and Response (NDR). With this certification, SK Shieldus can provide high-efficiency cybersecurity environments for enterprises operating services or planning cloud transformation within the AWS cloud environment. Currently, its services combine AWS native security services with the AI-based security monitoring platform 'Secudium,' offering optimized cloud security monitoring services. SK Shieldus plans to utilize its accumulated cloud security expertise to expand its service scope to more industries, helping clients respond to increasingly complex cyber threats.",
    tags_en: ["SK Shieldus", "AWS", "TDR", "SOC", "SIEM", "SOAR", "XDR", "Cloud Security"],
